      "id": "claim_495e0cf2a602429eb6bbcfa4d46d95e6",
      "statement": "Make arguments have two meanings: words in TARGETS are goals and anything else is a Compose service word, resolved by filtering the target words out of MAKECMDGOALS and falling back to the first entry of SERVICES.",
