    {
      "id": "claim_59e64d410a0343d094bab46155f2cefa",
      "statement": "SERVICES is deliberately excluded from the service-word filter, because filtering it too would silently redirect a named second service to the default service, and a word that is neither a target nor a known service fails on the placeholder rule rather than reaching Compose.",
